{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=April 2019}}
'''Group E of the [[2019 Africa Cup of Nations]]''' took place from 24 June to 2 July 2019. The group consisted of [[Angola national football team|Angola]], [[Mali national football team|Mali]], [[Mauritania national football team|Mauritania]] and [[Tunisia national football team|Tunisia]].<ref>{{cite news |url=http://www.cafonline.com/en-US/NewsCenter/News/NewsDetails?id=vxbNdpc613I1EvyJc1T0uQ%3d%3d |title=The AFCON 2019 games revealed |website=CAFonline.com |publisher=[[Confederation of African Football]] |date=12 April 2019 |access-date=12 April 2019}}</ref>

Mali and Tunisia advanced to the round of 16.

