In the [[2019 Africa Cup of Nations knockout stage#Round of 16|round of 16]]:<ref name="regulations">{{cite web|url=http://www.cafonline.com/Portals/0/Regulations%20and%20Official%20Documents/Competitions%20Regulation/Regulation%20AFCON.pdf|title=Regulations of the Africa Cup of Nations|publisher=Confederation of African Football|format=PDF}}</ref>
* The winners of Group E, [[Mali national football team|Mali]] advanced to play the runners-up of [[2019 Africa Cup of Nations Group D|Group D]], [[Ivory Coast national football team|Ivory Coast]].
* The runners-up of Group E, [[Tunisia national football team|Tunisia]], advanced to play the winners of [[2019 Africa Cup of Nations Group F|Group F]], [[Ghana national football team|Ghana]].

